```uvl
features
	eShop
		mandatory
			Catalogue
			Security
				alternative
					High {Price 100}
					Standard {Price 50}
		optional
			SEO
			Payment
				alternative
					"Bank Transfer" {Price 10, SEPA true}
					"Credit Card" {Price 20}
			Platform
				or
					"Mobile App"
					Browser {URL 'www.uvleshop.org'}

constraints
	"Credit Card" => High
	!("Bank Transfer" & "Mobile App")
```